 Undo the last change?

 ✗ A file was changed by hand

 C:\Users\you\.gitconfig was changed by hand since Devpit wrote it

 1. Open the file named above and put back what Devpit wrote, or keep your edit.
 2. Devpit only takes back lines it wrote itself, so it stopped instead of guessing.
 3. Run devpit accounts verify to see where things stand.

